# Vite build output is generated; only the two hand-written placeholders are tracked so
# `go build`/`go test` compile and serve the embed without requiring a node build.
#
# favicon.svg is authored in web/public/ and copied here verbatim by the build -- it is not
# generated, which is why tracking it does not track a build artifact. Keep the two in sync; the
# test in favicon_test.go serves this copy, and web/index.html references it by the same path.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!favicon.svg
